  "description": "Magress lived only for revenge, but ultimately died a knight's valiant death in battle. His own revenge was left unfulfilled. Although, historians wonder, had he achieved his ultimate revenge, would the spell of vengeance actually have been broken? Even if the Six Heroes had rallied to repel the gods, could he have ever stopped fighting? According to a friend of Magress, \"He was a man best described as one with madness lurking within the shadow of mercy.\" We can only wonder what his fate awaited when he freed his true self and manifested as a god of destruction.",
